{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん こんばんワンダフォー＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！58回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\n世界のパンさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/16/3452940/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/16/3452940/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"威嚇顔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/16/3452940/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は学校おわりの妹と\n銭湯に行ってきたよー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく楽しかった！\nまた、おやすみの日に一緒にいきたいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は今日、妹は友達と約束してたんだけど、\n今日はお姉ちゃんを優先してくれたよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やったよ～お姉ちゃんやったよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃は私の後ろを\n私の通ってきた道通りについてきてたのに\nいつのまにか、あとを追いかけてもこないし\nお姉ちゃんより友達だし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きくなることは寂しいですね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にとっては妹はずっと可愛くて\n私が通って安全か確認できた道を\n通って欲しいし\n何でもしてあげたくなる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん、お姉ちゃんのワガママにも\n付き合って欲しいけど！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また今度銭湯行くの楽しみだな～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の夜ご飯は\nつくれる料理の中から\nカレーを選んで\nみんなの夜ご飯をつくったよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またカレー？と思ってる人もいるかもだけど\nそんなにカレーではないよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し久しぶりカレーだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はしろみときみの家を洗って\nお部屋を掃除しよう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜ご飯もつくって\n午前中から1人で銭湯にでもいこうかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は銭湯に行ってもうヘトヘトで\n眠たいから短めなブログです。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/16/3452940/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/16/3452940/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  ことみよさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎おっはよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎こっんばんはー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  イッシーさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎まいちゅんの「今、なにそれって思ったでしょ」って言った時のまいちゅんの言い方とちょっとムスッとしながら聞いてるきいちゃんの表情。その姿想像するだけでこっちも楽しくなっちゃうね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎その想像通りだと思います(´ー｀)♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんと言い合いになったとしても\n兄弟喧嘩みたいになりそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"譲ってくれるのはまいちゅんだろうけど！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(200)  さるちゃんさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんの趣味ってなんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎趣味は特にないけど最近は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"癒し探しをしてる！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何が自分にとって癒されるのか！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動物はもちろんだけど\n例えばお風呂グッツの検索とか\n家具の検索とか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(216)  まりりんさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎半年ぶりの握手会、、四月まで待てないよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎いえーい！4月たのしみにしてるよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(450)  ぱうさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きぃちゃんのコミュ力の高さ、会話の反射神経みたいなものと融合すると、ラジオでのトークはさらに面白くなるものね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎そんなふうに言ってもらえてうれしいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんとまいちゅんと3人で乃木ののに\n出たときの回、結構お気に入りです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3人の個性が会話からすごい出てる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/16/3452940/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナセレはこれでおわりー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナセレは短いね(ノ_・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/16/3452940/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n50回目はゆうた鳩かりんごさんからです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わりだ！ぜぜぜぜぜーい！"}],"source":"archive"}